{"text":"{
  "status": "STABLE",
  "core_findings": [
    "Sampled training positives outrank negatives in 91.8–99.4% of valid positions across four categories (10 batches; 10,317–15,963 positions/category). These position-weighted observations establish training separation; held-out validation ranking and uncertainty intervals are unavailable.",
    "Industrial_and_Scientific has the most concentrated endpoint representations: effective rank 8.12 versus 22.14 for Movies_and_TV, 13.75 for Electronics and 29.71 for CDs_and_Vinyl, using unit-normalized features from 200 identified training users/category. Identity and batch-reordering controls pass, but representation rank alone does not establish ranking quality."
  ],
  "key_implications": [
    "Training separation is strongest for CDs_and_Vinyl and weakest for Industrial_and_Scientific under the sampled negatives; this does not establish their relative validation performance.",
    "Industrial_and_Scientific uses fewer effective representation directions, without evidence here that this concentration harms recommendations.",
    "Omitted sensitivity and candidate-depth results prevent conclusions about temporal dependence or candidate-depth robustness; no held-out macro HR@10 is available."
  ],
  "evidence": {
    "headline_metrics": {
      "Movies_and_TV:pairwise_accuracy": 0.9856431044675281,
      "Industrial_and_Scientific:pairwise_accuracy": 0.9178403755868545,
      "Electronics:pairwise_accuracy": 0.9333139478530581,
      "CDs_and_Vinyl:pairwise_accuracy": 0.9942366723047046,
      "Industrial_and_Scientific:intact_endpoint_unit_effective_rank": 8.124787239123124,
      "all_categories:identity_and_batch_reordering_max_absolute_difference": 0.0
    },
    "brief_metric_read": {
      "pairwise_accuracy": "Strong training separation conditional on sampled negative difficulty; not held-out HR.",
      "effective_rank": "Covariance concentration, not evidence of useful or harmful ranking.",
      "checks": "Reported identity and batch-order feature comparisons pass."
    }
  }
}"}
